Package: teams
Version: 0.9.23
Section: user/network
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python, python-pyside.qtcore, python-pyside.qtgui, python-pyside.qtdeclarative, libqt4-declarative, qt-components, libmeegotouchcore0
Maintainer: Sebastian Matkovich <sebastian.matkovich@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/smatkovi/harbour-teams
Description: Microsoft Teams for MeeGo Harmattan
 Native Teams client with conversation support: chats, teams and channels,
 messages, file attachments and avatars.
 .
 Python 2.7 draws the window with PySide, but the work happens in a newer
 Python: Harmattan's own one cannot speak the TLS that
 login.microsoftonline.com requires, so teams_api.py is run as a subprocess
 by /opt/wunderw/bin/python3.11 and answers one JSON command at a time.
Maemo-Display-Name: Teams
XB-Maemo-Icon-26:
@ICON@
